{
  "note": [
    "Labelled golden fixtures for the 'check the math' derivation.",
    "Each scenario states the analysis aggregates a briefing is built from and the exact",
    "figures the derivation must recover from that briefing. The analysis spec is aggregates",
    "only — record counts, per-department money, and attribution totals. There is no prompt,",
    "no conversation, no query sample and no free text here, because a briefing carries none",
    "and a fixture that carried one would be testing a payload the product cannot produce.",
    "Every expected number below is stated to the cent or to six decimal places, which is the",
    "precision the briefing file stores. A change that moves any of them fails this fixture",
    "with a named-field diff rather than a whole-object dump."
  ],
